      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IM ON NO SLEEP (9) was out of the money two runs back at Riverina Paceway then was at her best last start to score by 3.5 metres over 1660m at Parkes. Will enjoy a pretty soft run from this draw, with the sprint lane to play a big role. Has the talent to take care of this field. LADY OF HOPE (2) finished seventh last start, beaten 25 metres at Dubbo over 2120m. Expected to run well. JASPERSTIMETOSHINE (1) could only manage fifth first-up two runs ago then broke in the run and finished a long last at the latest appearance over 1660m at Parkes. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Won't find this any harder and he can bounce back if he brings his Mitch Manners. KINGS FURY (5) is in the mix following a fourth at his most recent appearance over 1740m at Riverina Paceway.",
